# English-only (pk-backend-app)

This repository must not contain Chinese or any CJK characters (Han, Hiragana, Katakana, Hangul).

## Required

- Write all code, comments, logs, config, SQL, tests, and markdown in **English**.
- Keep API `msg` fields in **English**; use `*Display` fields for localized UI strings (`id-ID`).
- Run `./mvnw clean verify` before finishing; `NoCjkTextTest` must pass.

## Forbidden

- Chinese (or CJK) in comments, docs, variable names, commit messages, or "temporary" notes.
- Copying Chinese text from Feishu product docs into repo files.

## If requirements are in Chinese

Read external docs for intent, implement and document in English only.
